Package: SurgicalTrainingLab
Type: ShinyApp
Title: Surgical Training Lab - Threshold Policies
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Interactive Shiny application for exploring cognitive threshold policies
    in surgical training contexts. Implements three paradigms: Adaptive Gain (Inverted-U),
    Dual-Criterion (Signal Detection Theory), and Time-on-Task (Fatigue-Adaptive).
